              <p class="faq-answer-text">A recruitment specialist reads every message and replies within one business day to book a short call about your hiring goals or your job search.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-3="" data-wf-component-id="8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6c7" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="faq-item">
