                    <path d="M12 5V19M5 12H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6c7&quot;,&quot;8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6cd&quot;],[&quot;569a09da-4074-ce63-e5f5-bebd425b4a09&quot;]]]" class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Tell us the roles you need to fill, your ideal start date, location or remote setup and budget. If you are a candidate, share the role you want and a link to your resume.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-3="" data-wf-component-id="8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6c7" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
