                    <path d="M12 5V19M5 12H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6c7&quot;,&quot;8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6cd&quot;],[&quot;9ebe796c-5011-cfa2-f7ce-4230327bb36e&quot;]]]" class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. Most of our searches are run remotely, and we place candidates with companies across North America, Europe, Africa and Asia.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-3="" data-wf-component-id="8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6c7" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">
              <div class="faq-question-text">How do you handle the details I send?</div>
              <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6c7&quot;,&quot;8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6cb&quot;],[&quot;85436bb7-25fa-cb42-7939-47d29f581e03&quot;]]]" class="faq-icon-wrap">
                <div class="w-embed"><svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M12 5V19M5 12H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
                  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div data-wf-target="[[[&quot;8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6c7&quot;,&quot;8ef53cdc-ba71-fce0-7948-ef9525fde6cd&quot;],[&quot;85436bb7-25fa-cb42-7939-47d29f581e03&quot;]]]" class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Your message is stored securely, used only to respond to your inquiry and never shared with third parties. Ask us at any time and we will delete it.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
